• Develop high-quality client deliverables, including presentations, business cases, roadmaps, operating models and implementation plans. &nbsp;

• Facilitate interviews, workshops and working sessions with client stakeholders and Baringa colleagues. &nbsp;

• Coordinate effectively across multidisciplinary teams and contribute to an inclusive, collaborative delivery environment. &nbsp;

• Support the development of junior colleagues through coaching, feedback and on-the-job guidance. &nbsp;

• Contribute to proposals, thought leadership, capability development and other activities that help grow our US business. &nbsp;

Your skills and experience &nbsp;

